&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Frontend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help us build the next generation of Flo’s platform and user experiences.&lt;br&gt;You’ll work on the foundation that powers interactive surveys and dynamic content inside the Flo app — building SDKs, reusable components, and internal tooling that enable other product teams to deliver exceptional experiences quickly and reliably.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our frontend stack is based on &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Next.js&lt;/strong&gt;, with a strong focus on performance, maintainability, and testing.&lt;br&gt;We care deeply about quality: we use TypeScript for type safety, Jest and Playwright for automated testing, and continuously evolve our design system and UI Kit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain high-quality user-facing components and platform SDKs that enable survey and interactive experiences in the Flo ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, design, and backend engineers to deliver flexible and scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Flo’s design system and shared UI libraries, ensuring consistency and reusability across products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refactor and improve existing codebases for performance, reliability, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, modular, well-documented code and advocate for engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in the frontend community at Flo, sharing ideas and driving improvements in architecture and development processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience building, shipping, and maintaining modern web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level knowledge of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript (ES6+).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with React and modern frontend tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grasp of object-oriented design patterns and the ability to write efficient, well-structured algorithms&lt;/li&gt;
