&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Must have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience as QA Engineer/Manual Tester;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical mindset;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in using any of Proxy/ API tools, any SQL tool, GitHub/Bitbucket;&lt;/li&gt;
