&lt;li&gt;ML data engineering: synthetic data generation, evaluation dataset design, annotation pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare, regulated industry, or safety-critical AI systems experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prompt optimisation frameworks (DSPy or similar), feature stores (Tecton)&lt;/li&gt;
