&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with mobile CI/CD pipelines, including build automation, automated testing, and release workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience integrating with BI and analytics platforms, with familiarity in designing and interpreting A/B tests to drive product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
