&lt;li&gt;Experience optimising web funnels, checkout flows and subscription-based products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with segmentation, driver analysis, and measurement frameworks where relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using analytical languages such as SQL, Python, or R&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with stakeholders of varying research maturity, effectively educating them on the value of UX research in their workflows&lt;/li&gt;
