&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional experience designing mobile applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio demonstrating expertise in systemic design, advanced prototyping skills, micro-interactions, and the ability to architect solutions with measurable product impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating scalable frameworks, contribution to design systems, and interaction models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing gamified or behaviour-change-driven experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Figma and advanced prototyping tools (e.g., Protopie).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using motion and animation tools (e.g., Lottie, Rive, After Effects).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI/LLM tools to accelerate design exploration and streamline concept validation (e.g., Claude, Vercel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills; ability to distill complex ideas into clear narratives and influence stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
