&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex design projects (0 → 1), creating scalable frameworks and systems that support growth and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively tackle complex and ambiguous challenges, defining requirements and prioritising the most impactful workstreams to deliver clear, compelling, user-centred experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
